    "created_at": "2020-05-14T10:17:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-14T10:17:12Z",
    "body": "So Safari is shipping the spec afaict. I'm fixing Gecko to follow the spec and unprefix the pseudo-classes, and I reopened https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=255351.\r\n\r\nSo this can probably be closed for now if there's nobody actively working on changing the spec further?",
